{"page":449,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"6.4 • 스위치 근거리 네트워크","words":[{"text":"6.4","x":1036,"y":142,"width":42,"height":24},{"text":"•","x":1111,"y":147,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"스위치","x":1157,"y":142,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"근거리","x":1246,"y":141,"width":77,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크","x":1336,"y":140,"width":105,"height":30}]},{"text":"그림 6.15의 최상단 스위치와 그림 6.22의 스위치 테이블에 대해 이들 규칙을 적","words":[{"text":"그림","x":231,"y":263,"width":64,"height":36},{"text":"6.15의","x":313,"y":263,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"최상단","x":432,"y":264,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"스위치와","x":545,"y":265,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":693,"y":265,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"6.22의","x":771,"y":266,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"스위치","x":885,"y":268,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"테이블에","x":1002,"y":268,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":1152,"y":268,"width":62,"height":37},{"text":"이들","x":1233,"y":268,"width":67,"height":38},{"text":"규칙을","x":1314,"y":267,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"적","x":1432,"y":267,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"용해 보자. 목적지 주소 62-FE-F7-11-89•A3을 가진 프레임이 인터페이스 1로부터 스","words":[{"text":"용해","x":166,"y":323,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"보자.","x":245,"y":323,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"목적지","x":337,"y":323,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"주소","x":451,"y":326,"width":67,"height":36},{"text":"62-FE-F7-11-89•A3을","x":531,"y":325,"width":341,"height":37},{"text":"가진","x":887,"y":326,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"프레임이","x":966,"y":327,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스","x":1116,"y":327,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"1로부터","x":1301,"y":327,"width":112,"height":38},{"text":"스","x":1432,"y":329,"width":33,"height":29}]},{"text":"위치에 도착했다고 가정하자. 스위치는 자신의 테이블에서 목적지가 인터페이스 1에","words":[{"text":"위치에","x":167,"y":383,"width":96,"height":39},{"text":"도착했다고","x":283,"y":384,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"가정하자.","x":470,"y":384,"width":139,"height":39},{"text":"스위치는","x":627,"y":385,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":775,"y":384,"width":95,"height":39},{"text":"테이블에서","x":892,"y":386,"width":163,"height":39},{"text":"목적지가","x":1075,"y":387,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스","x":1228,"y":386,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"1에","x":1417,"y":386,"width":45,"height":38}]},{"text":"연결된 랜 세그먼트(즉, 전기공학과 랜)에 있는지 살펴본다. 이것은 프레임이 목적지가","words":[{"text":"연결된","x":168,"y":444,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"랜","x":281,"y":445,"width":31,"height":36},{"text":"세그먼트(즉,","x":326,"y":445,"width":189,"height":39},{"text":"전기공학과","x":531,"y":444,"width":165,"height":39},{"text":"랜)에","x":709,"y":445,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"있는지","x":800,"y":445,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"살펴본다.","x":910,"y":446,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"이것은","x":1070,"y":447,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"프레임이","x":1182,"y":446,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"목적지가","x":1330,"y":447,"width":136,"height":38}]},{"text":"있는 랜 세그먼트로 이미 브로드개스트 됐음을 뜻한다. 따라서 스위치는 그 프레임을","words":[{"text":"있는","x":168,"y":505,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"랜","x":249,"y":505,"width":30,"height":37},{"text":"세그먼트로","x":296,"y":505,"width":170,"height":37},{"text":"이미","x":482,"y":505,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"브로드개스트","x":562,"y":506,"width":198,"height":37},{"text":"됐음을","x":776,"y":505,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"뜻한다.","x":889,"y":506,"width":109,"height":38},{"text":"따라서","x":1016,"y":507,"width":97,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":1132,"y":507,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"그","x":1282,"y":511,"width":34,"height":27},{"text":"프레임을","x":1331,"y":507,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"여과(폐기)한다. 이제 똑같은 목적지 주소를 가진 프레임이 인터페이스 2로 도착했다","words":[{"text":"여과(폐기)한다.","x":167,"y":566,"width":235,"height":39},{"text":"이제","x":421,"y":566,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"똑같은","x":502,"y":566,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"목적지","x":616,"y":566,"width":95,"height":38},{"text":"주소를","x":730,"y":567,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"가진","x":846,"y":567,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"프레임이","x":927,"y":567,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스","x":1080,"y":567,"width":167,"height":38},{"text":"2로","x":1262,"y":570,"width":54,"height":30},{"text":"도착했다","x":1332,"y":567,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"고 가정하자. 스위치는 자신의 테이블을 참조해서 목적지가 인터페이스 1쪽에 있음-을","words":[{"text":"고","x":165,"y":632,"width":32,"height":27},{"text":"가정하자.","x":213,"y":627,"width":143,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":373,"y":627,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"자신의","x":522,"y":626,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"테이블을","x":637,"y":627,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"참조해서","x":782,"y":626,"width":130,"height":39},{"text":"목적지가","x":930,"y":628,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스","x":1082,"y":627,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"1쪽에","x":1268,"y":627,"width":80,"height":37},{"text":"있음-을","x":1368,"y":627,"width":99,"height":37}]},{"text":"알게 된다. 따라서 스위치는 프레임을 인터페이스 1의 출력 버퍼로 전달한다. 스위치","words":[{"text":"알게","x":166,"y":687,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"된다.","x":248,"y":687,"width":74,"height":37},{"text":"따라서","x":341,"y":688,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":458,"y":687,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":606,"y":688,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"인터페이스","x":756,"y":687,"width":165,"height":38},{"text":"1의","x":941,"y":688,"width":45,"height":38},{"text":"출력","x":1005,"y":688,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"버퍼로","x":1090,"y":688,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"전달한다.","x":1207,"y":687,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"스위치","x":1365,"y":687,"width":98,"height":38}]},{"text":"테이블이 완벽하고 정확하다면, 스위치는 프레임을 브로드개스트하지 않고 목적지로","words":[{"text":"테이블이","x":166,"y":748,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"완벽하고","x":315,"y":749,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"정확하다면,","x":470,"y":748,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"스위치는","x":660,"y":748,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"프레임을","x":809,"y":748,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"브로드개스트하지","x":960,"y":749,"width":268,"height":37},{"text":"않고","x":1249,"y":749,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"목적지로","x":1332,"y":748,"width":135,"height":37}]},{"text":"전달한다는 것을 이 예에서 명확히 알게 되었다.","words":[{"text":"전달한다는","x":167,"y":808,"width":166,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":347,"y":810,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"이","x":427,"y":809,"width":29,"height":39},{"text":"예에서","x":472,"y":809,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"명확히","x":587,"y":809,"width":92,"height":38},{"text":"알게","x":696,"y":809,"width":63,"height":38},{"text":"되었다.","x":775,"y":809,"width":105,"height":37}]},{"text":"이런 의미에서 스위치는 허브보다 “똑똑하다”. 그러나 무엇보다도 스위치 테이블","words":[{"text":"이런","x":230,"y":869,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"의미에서","x":313,"y":870,"width":131,"height":38},{"text":"스위치는","x":463,"y":870,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"허브보다","x":614,"y":870,"width":132,"height":38},{"text":"“똑똑하다”.","x":761,"y":869,"width":168,"height":38},{"text":"그러나","x":947,"y":870,"width":103,"height":37},{"text":"무엇보다도","x":1065,"y":870,"width":170,"height":38},{"text":"스위치","x":1250,"y":869,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"테이블","x":1366,"y":869,"width":101,"height":37}]},{"text":"이 어떻게 구성되는 것일까? 네트워크 계층 라우팅 프로토콜에 해당하는 링크 계층 기","words":[{"text":"이","x":166,"y":932,"width":26,"height":36},{"text":"어떻게","x":211,"y":930,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"구성되는","x":323,"y":931,"width":137,"height":37},{"text":"것일까?","x":474,"y":930,"width":115,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크","x":605,"y":930,"width":130,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":750,"y":930,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"라우팅","x":830,"y":930,"width":94,"height":38},{"text":"프로토콜에","x":942,"y":931,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"해당하는","x":1126,"y":930,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"링크","x":1276,"y":930,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"계층","x":1355,"y":930,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"기","x":1436,"y":929,"width":26,"height":37}]},{"text":"능이 있는 것일까? 또는 관리자가 스위치 테이블을 수동으로 구성해야 하는 것일까?","words":[{"text":"능이","x":165,"y":991,"width":60,"height":39},{"text":"있는","x":244,"y":991,"width":65,"height":36},{"text":"것일까?","x":324,"y":991,"width":116,"height":38},{"text":"또는","x":453,"y":993,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"관리자가","x":533,"y":991,"width":134,"height":37},{"text":"스위치","x":678,"y":991,"width":96,"height":37},{"text":"테이블을","x":791,"y":991,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"수동으로","x":936,"y":991,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"구성해야","x":1086,"y":991,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"하는","x":1234,"y":991,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"것일까?","x":1316,"y":991,"width":114,"height":36}]},{"text":"자기학습","words":[{"text":"자기학습","x":165,"y":1095,"width":139,"height":40}]},{"text":"스위치는 자신의 테이블을 자동으로, 동적으로, 자치적으로[네트워크 관리자나 구성","words":[{"text":"스위치는","x":163,"y":1166,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"자신의","x":313,"y":1166,"width":99,"height":39},{"text":"테이블을","x":434,"y":1166,"width":135,"height":38},{"text":"자동으로,","x":586,"y":1166,"width":141,"height":38},{"text":"동적으로,","x":745,"y":1167,"width":144,"height":37},{"text":"자치적으로[네트워크","x":908,"y":1167,"width":323,"height":39},{"text":"관리자나","x":1247,"y":1166,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"구성","x":1399,"y":1166,"width":63,"height":38}]},{"text":"(configuration) 프로토콜의 개입 없이] 구축하는 놀라운 특징이 있다(특히 업무가 많","words":[{"text":"(configuration)","x":162,"y":1230,"width":229,"height":37},{"text":"프로토콜의","x":408,"y":1227,"width":166,"height":37},{"text":"개입","x":594,"y":1227,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"없이]","x":676,"y":1227,"width":74,"height":38},{"text":"구축하는","x":769,"y":1227,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"놀라운","x":918,"y":1227,"width":105,"height":37},{"text":"특징이","x":1037,"y":1228,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"있다(특히","x":1157,"y":1227,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"업무가","x":1319,"y":1227,"width":99,"height":37},{"text":"많","x":1433,"y":1227,"width":33,"height":37}]},{"text":"은 네트워크 관리자에게 있어서는). 다시 말해서 스위치는 자가학습(self-learning)을","words":[{"text":"은","x":162,"y":1288,"width":31,"height":35},{"text":"네트워크","x":209,"y":1287,"width":133,"height":37},{"text":"관리자에게","x":358,"y":1287,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"있어서는).","x":546,"y":1287,"width":151,"height":39},{"te